      "raw_text": "} privacy games adversary challenger We break down the anatomy of game-based privacy Based on this anatomy, we propose a unified representa- of five fundamental privacy risks as games: membership Using the game-based framework, we establish and rig- between the above risks. Similarly concrete security in cryptography [6], we define reduction between privacy properties.",
